# Local launcher config — copy this file to "launcher.local" (which is
# gitignored) and set PYTHON to the interpreter that has this project's
# dependencies (rumps) installed. The .command launchers source it.
#
# If you skip this, the launcher falls back to whatever `python3` is on PATH.
#
# Conda env example:
#   PYTHON="$HOME/anaconda3/envs/Mini_app_navigator/bin/python3"
#
# venv example:
#   PYTHON="$(pwd)/.venv/bin/python3"

PYTHON=""
